<Base title="About" description="Pham Huy Hoang (Rex), a security engineer focused on security architecture, cloud security, DevSecOps and AppSec.">
  <h1 class="shine">Hi, I'm Hoàng (Rex).</h1>
  <div class="prose about">
    <p>
      I'm a security engineer based in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. I have spent 8+ years in cybersecurity and 10+ years
      in IT, working on infrastructure, cloud and software delivery for banks, fintech and tech companies.
    </p>
    <p>
      My focus is on security architecture, cloud security, DevSecOps and AppSec, and I'm currently learning AI
      security. I like security that fits into the way teams already work: checks that run in the pipeline,
      infrastructure as code, a trusted software supply chain, and access that is easy to track.
    </p>
    <h2>Why this site</h2>
    <p>
      I learn best by doing, and I remember best by writing things down. This is where I share my notes, labs and
      tools, so others can learn from them too.
    </p>
    <h2>The name</h2>
    <p>
      "HoangBeard" is Hoàng, my Vietnamese name, plus the beard I've had for years. My close friends call me
      "Hoàng Râu", which means "Hoàng the Beard". In English, I go by Rex. I like it because it's short, strong and a
      little different, like the T-rex in my logo.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/hoangbeard">GitHub</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hoangbeard/">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

